WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Jian Tong, why are you so mean?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,470
work work work

3
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:06,970
You said it nicely

4
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:09,470
Isn’t your job just to please men?

5
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:12,890
I'm so eager to please men before I've raised them well.

6
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:16,460
Is rebuttal useful? Indeed

7
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:20,590
It's true that I knelt down for money

8
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:23,590
I lie down and imitate a dog wagging its tail for more money

9
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:48,060
What he has collected are all facts, Lu Chen

10
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:51,700
The most beautiful woman you have ever seen?

11
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:56,050
Or do you understand me, Ah Chen?

12
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:58,180
This is the most contradictory woman I have ever seen

13
00:00:58,180 --> 00:00:59,180
Infinite humility

14
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:01,560
Infinite pride

15
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:04,560
Have you ever seen anyone act humble and proud like a delicate sheep?

16
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,560
I want to wake up the real her
